WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.725
Get this right first, because
every other rule depends on it.

2
00:00:03.725 --> 00:00:07.580
A GCC Moderate tenant uses
the worldwide endpoints,

3
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.525
the same as a commercial
tenant: Learn says so plainly.

4
00:00:11.525 --> 00:00:17.223
Office 365 GCC is paired with Microsoft
Entra ID in Azure, the commercial cloud,

5
00:00:17.223 --> 00:00:20.554
so tokens come from the
worldwide sign-in host,

6
00:00:20.554 --> 00:00:24.850
and Graph and Resource Manager
are the worldwide hosts too.

7
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:28.967
The slide maps the two names the
code knows, worldwide and GCC,

8
00:00:28.967 --> 00:00:32.837
including the PowerShell
environment names you'll pass.

9
00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:36.600
They resolve to the same values,
but each is its own name.
